      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We need this BIGTIME!\n\nThis would make avatars with firearms so much more immersive, because you can simply animate them with the custom kinematics for manipulation, reloads, etc. Not to mention the benefits for avatars with more than 2 legs.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
